<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
     The launch's still (Jesse, 2026-11-01; BP app references/launch-ball): BP yellow (#FCE804) with
     the app icon's "Bp" in its ink (#111111), B and p at 90% of their size and no ! yet. It is the
     first frame of the launch animation (`LaunchBall`), so the hand-off can't be seen: the same
     249.6 pt Bp! canvas, centred on the screen, each letter shrunk about the middle of its foot on
     the baseline. The letters are `LaunchMarkB` and `LaunchMarkP` on the Daily mark's canvas, and
     every number below comes from `LaunchMotion` (90% of 249.6 x 140.25, offset from the centre).
     Yellow and ink in light and dark alike. iPhone caches this screen: reinstall to see a change.
     (2026-09-18 to 2026-11-01 it was bare paper, Jesse's no-splash call, now reversed.)
-->
